  "readmeFile": "READMEForNuGet.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.1-beta: The separate package ISO22900.II-Sharp.Abstractions is discontinued; interfaces, data classes, enums and exceptions are part of ISO22900.II-Sharp again (same namespaces). Remove any reference to ISO22900.II-Sharp.Abstractions. 1.4.0-beta: New interfaces IComPrimitive and IDiagPduApiOneSysLevel; IModule.OpenComLogicalLink returns IComLogicalLink and IComLogicalLink.StartCop returns IComPrimitive, so code using the interfaces must be recompiled. IModule, IComLogicalLink and IComPrimitive derive from IDisposable. Data classes returned by the interfaces have public constructors so own implementations (simulators, test doubles) can create them. The blocking ComPrimitive.WaitForCopResult(ct) now also rethrows OperationCanceledException when ct is cancelled (same behavior as the async variant); ApiModifications.LEGACY_SWALLOW_COP_CANCELLATION restores the old behavior for both. 1.3.2-beta: ComPrimitive.WaitForCopResultAsync(ct) now rethrows OperationCanceledException when ct is cancelled instead of returning an empty result. Use ApiModifications.LEGACY_SWALLOW_COP_CANCELLATION to keep the old behavior.",
